ll,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-16T15:47:42Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T09:12:37Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.stable.official [876b29033]\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy scene consists of a SubViewport in a SubViewportContainer. Inside the SubViewport, I have some Sprite2Ds. These Sprite2Ds have 1x1 pixel sized textures and are scaled, e.g. to 16x16 or 64x16.\n\nWhen activating \"Snap 2D Transforms to Pixel\", these Sprite2Ds are not rendered at their actual location if their \"centered\" property is turned on. Instead, they are shifted by half their width/height. This becomes apparent when overlaying a CollisionShape2D.\n\n<img width=\"1802\" height=\"942\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4115598b-fe55-4862-8173-23352821964e\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee above: Set up the scene as shown, have a 1x1 sized texture, add it to scaled Sprite2Ds inside the SubViewport and turn on \"Snap 2D Transforms to Pixel\".\n\nTurning off either \"Snap 2D Transforms to Pixel\" or the \"centered\" Property of the Sprite2D mitigates the effect. The issue also seems to not occur when using a sprite texture larger than 1x1 pixels.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[subviewport-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22366709/subviewport-test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110582/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110582/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}